# Goobers runtime state — belt-and-suspenders.
# The instance should be materialized OUTSIDE this repo, but never commit
# runtime state if someone materializes an instance inside this tree.
# The versioned config source (manifest.yaml, gaggles/, *.example, README.md)
# stays tracked.
instance.yaml
config/
runs/
gaggles/*/runs/
gaggles/*/workcopies/
scheduler/
telemetry.db
